// Pre-Technical Studies Grade 9 depth pass (18 Nov 2026). The first pass (13 Nov) gave 17 skills with 4 prerequisites in all, every
// misconception the same stock cause and a repair equal to the child's line, and many examples whose wrong answer no learner
// would pick ("A brick wall", "A butcher", "Very Added Tax"). Each misconception now has a real error, a believable wrong answer,
// the learner's reason and a repair. Seven knowledge skills cover the practical outcomes that had none (safety on raised
// platforms, oblique drawing, building a visual program, using holding and driving tools, planning and making the project, filling
// in a business plan); the making is marked with the KICD rubric. Prerequisites reach Grade 7 and 8 Pre-Technical, Mathematics,
// Science and Integrated Science skills. Safety lines carry SAFETY in their source; money lines that change with time carry MONEY.
// Merged by scripts/build-pretechnical-grade.mjs 9. Draft until a Pre-Technical Studies teacher reviews it.
import { B, P, M, SAFETY, MONEY, RULE, RUBRIC } from './common.mjs';

